   "source": [
    "<font size = \"4\">\n",
    "\n",
    "In the previous example, we iterated over a list of strings, each of which is the name of a car. Sometimes it is helpful to know what position we are in the list\n",
    "\n",
    "There are two simple ways of doing this:"
   ]
